@short_title Caching data and off-line applications

{0 Caching the data and off-line applications}



{1 Caching the data}

Module {!Eliom.Cscache}
implements a cache of data that can be used both for
keeping data on client side or keeping values in memory during a
request.

Have a look at the documentation of this module for more information.

Also have a look at {!/ocsigenserver.baselib/Ocsigen_base.Cache} (from Ocsigen Server)
for a server-side cache that keeps the most recently used values.

{1 Off-line applications}

In the future, Eliom.Cscache will make it possible to save persistent
data, which is useful for implementing off-line applications.
